        cert['actor_types_review']=dict(finding='The previously C-only local history obligation now has B: actual six-field/all16 projector, arbitrary-header explicit seed/reset/first-draw handoff, native initialized prefix/all16 reset frame and actual loader actor contribution. Actual normal path remains independently C/D.',recommendation='This removes the C-only renderer-history reason for holding actor_types. Supervisor may review verified-under-assumptions after importing the B properties/source locks and explicit service/frame assumptions. It does not justify the old verified-within-contract proposal by aggregation.',stronger='A for the complete admitted persistence/composition property requires a fully discharged all-slot/all-prefix addressing and write-frame link through every normal mode-entry/placement/bootstrap path and pixel-service frame (or explicit contracted platform ownership), with actual projection/caller seams and source locks. Finite resource A and sample cross-mode C do not establish that whole property.',status_changed=False)
